{"heroId":78,"art":{"card":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/deadpack_card.webp","background":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/backgrounds/deadpack_bg.webp","vertical":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/deadpack_vertical.webp"},"text":{"en":{"role":"","playstyle":"","lore":"\"Ladies and Gentlemen, I'm going to tell you a shocking secret: at Fairfax Industries we know nothing about safety. Now let me tell you something even MORE shocking... that's a good thing! Now in my tenure here I have been shot, stabbed, impaled, defenestrated, blown up, atomized, and decapitated-not once. not twice. not thrice. but quice. That's right, my head has been cut off enough times that I had to use a made up word to quantify it.<br><br>But I put myself through figurative and sometimes literal hell because it's not enough to THINK about how things go wrong, we need to KNOW how things go wrong.<br><br>Now the demonstration you are about to witness is extremely dangerous. So sit back. Put on your safety googles. And bear witness to the miracle of flight courtesy of Fairfax Industries, and the Chimera Mark 1.\"<br><br><span class=\"italics\">- This transcription of Danny's opening remarks at The Military Technology Expo has been provided by Fairfax Industries</span>","tags":["Reckless","High-flying","Explosive"]},"es":{"role":"","playstyle":"","lore":"«Damas y caballeros, os voy a confesar un secreto escandaloso: en Fairfax Industries no tenemos ni idea de seguridad. Y ahora dejad que os cuente algo todavía MÁS escandaloso... ¡Eso es bueno! Durante mi tiempo aquí me han disparado, apuñalado, empalado, defenestrado, volado por los aires, atomizado y decapitado... no una, no dos, no tres, sino cuatrecientas veces. Así es, me han cortado la cabeza tantas veces que he tenido que inventarme una palabra para cuantificarlo.<br><br>Pero me hago pasar por un infierno figurado y, en ocasiones, literal, porque no basta con PENSAR en cómo pueden salir mal las cosas: necesitamos SABER cómo salen mal las cosas.<br><br>La demostración que estáis a punto de presenciar es extremadamente peligrosa. Así que reclinaos en vuestros asientos, poneos las gafas de protección y sed testigos del milagro de volar por cortesía de Fairfax Industries y el Quimera Mark 1».<br><br><span class=\"italics\">- Transcripción de las palabras de apertura de Danny en la Exposición de Tecnología Militar facilitada por Fairfax Industries.</span>","tags":["Temerario","Ambicioso","Explosivo"]}},"abilities":{"en":[{"id":2603013853,"slot":1,"ultimate":false,"name":"Strix Salvo","img":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/deadpack/deadpack_salvo.webp","quip":[],"sections":[{"text":[{"t":"Launch a "},{"t":"salvo of spirit missiles that lodge into the ground along a line.","hi":true},{"t":" The missiles explode after a delay or upon detecting an enemy, dealing "},{"t":"spirit damage","attr":"SpiritDamage","icon":"attr_SpiritDamage"},{"t":" and "},{"t":"marking","hi":true},{"t":" the target. Shooting a marked enemy with a charged shot consumes a mark to deal "},{"t":"bonus spirit damage","attr":"BonusSpiritDamage","icon":"attr_BonusSpiritDamage"},{"t":" and apply a fading "},{"t":"slow","attr":"Slow","icon":"attr_Slow"},{"t":". "},{"t":"Hold and drag to select the angle.","dim":true}],"groups":[{"stats":[{"label":"Damage","value":"27","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/damage_magic_color.svg","spirit":0.74},{"label":"Marked Damage","value":"45","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/damage_magic_color.svg","spirit":1.1},{"label":"Fading Slow","value":"40","unit":"%","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/condition_slow.svg"}]}],"basics":[{"label":"Mark Duration","value":"10.0","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/duration.svg"},{"label":"Slow Duration","value":"1.5","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/duration.svg"},{"label":"Explode Delay","value":"6.0","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/duration.svg"}]}],"cooldown":{"label":"Cooldown","value":"25","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/cooldown.svg"},"upgrades":[[{"t":"-12s Cooldown"}],[{"t":"+30 Damage +45 Marked Damage"}],[{"t":"+2 Missiles, Longer Range, and Improved Spirit Scaling"}]]},{"id":1904698842,"slot":2,"ultimate":false,"name":"Chimera Mk1","img":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/deadpack/deadpack_chimera.webp","quip":[],"sections":[{"text":[{"t":"Hold Jump / mantle to fly, building up heat. When max heat is reached, your jetpack will begin to overheat. "},{"t":"Overheating:","dim":true},{"t":" After a short delay, "},{"t":"dive to the ground.","hi":true},{"t":" Upon impact, create an explosion that "},{"t":"deals damage","hi":true},{"t":" and launches you and nearby enemies. If no hero is hit, you stun yourself. Press Ability 2 to dive early. "},{"t":"Cooling Down:","dim":true},{"t":" After overheating, the jetpack cannot be used until it fully cools down. "},{"t":"Slows affect you while airborne. You always explode on death."}],"groups":[{"stats":[{"label":"Cooldown","value":"21.0","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/cooldown.svg"},{"label":"Explosion Damage","value":"70","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/damage_magic_color.svg","spirit":1.5},{"label":"Explosion Damage","value":"70","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/damage_bullet_color.svg"}]}],"basics":[{"label":"Self Stun","value":"1.3","unit":"s"},{"label":"Self Damage","value":"10","unit":"% Max Health"}]}],"cooldown":{"label":"Cooldown","value":"21.0","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/cooldown.svg"},"upgrades":[[{"t":"Heat vents faster while grounded"}],[{"t":"On Hero Hit: Heal and take no self damage"}],[{"t":"On Hero Hit: -50% Cooldown and +120 Spirit Damage"}]]},{"id":374042410,"slot":3,"ultimate":false,"name":"Jettison Fuel","img":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/deadpack/deadpack_thermalmass.webp","quip":[],"sections":[{"text":[{"t":"Spray fuel dealing "},{"t":"weapon damage over time"},{"t":" and shredding "},{"t":"bullet resist","attr":"BulletResist","icon":"attr_BulletResist"},{"t":", building up to a "},{"t":"huge backblast","hi":true},{"t":" that deals "},{"t":"spirit damage","attr":"SpiritDamage","icon":"attr_SpiritDamage"},{"t":" and knocks you backwards. Vents the jetpack when dealing damage."}],"groups":[{"stats":[{"label":"Damage Per Second","value":"30","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/damage_bullet_color.svg"},{"label":"Burst Damage","value":"35","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/damage_magic_color.svg","spirit":0.95},{"label":"Bullet Resist","value":"-15","unit":"%","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/armor_bullet_color.svg"}]}],"basics":[{"label":"Debuff Duration","value":"7.0","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/duration.svg"}]}],"cooldown":{"label":"Cooldown","value":"22.0","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/icons/properties/cooldown.svg"},"upgrades":[[{"t":"-8s Cooldown","hi":true}],[{"t":"+60 Burst Damage On Backblast Hit: +18% Fire Rate for 7s"}],[{"t":"-10% Bullet